Wait — but the comment says "Prepending iterates newest-first: each insert lands at index 0" — for a single chunk that's correct (m inserts each O(window)). The old `loadOlder` path had the same prepend pattern but the window stayed bounded (eviction) — O(m·cap). During growOlderUntil eviction is suspended, so the window is unbounded → O(m·N) per page, O(N²) overall.

